{"Double-checked locking pattern is missing a re-check after acquiring the write lock, causing multiple goroutines that find the cache empty to all perform expensive I/O operations sequentially even though the first one has already populated the cache": 0.7405109405517578, "Holding the write lock during the entire I/O process blocks all other readers during the initial load, and it's better to minimize the time a lock is held": 0.32000336050987244}